msgid "Чтение из RabbitMQ, роутинг по jsonPath и переотправка в Citeck Event"
msgstr ""
"Reading from RabbitMQ -> routing by jsonPath -> forwarding to Citeck "
"Event + Dead Letter Queue"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/RabbitMQ_routing.rst:6
msgid "Пример демонстрирует типичный сценарий интеграции через RabbitMQ:"
msgstr "The example demonstrates a typical integration scenario via RabbitMQ:"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/RabbitMQ_routing.rst:8
msgid ""
"Подключение к очереди RabbitMQ с использованием credentials из ECOS "
"Endpoint."
msgstr ""
"Connecting to a RabbitMQ queue using credentials from an ECOS Endpoint."

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/RabbitMQ_routing.rst:9
msgid "Логирование входящего сообщения."
msgstr "Logging the incoming message."

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/RabbitMQ_routing.rst:10
msgid "Роутинг сообщения по значению поля ``operation`` в JSON-теле:"
msgstr "Routing the message based on the ``operation`` field value in the JSON body:"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/RabbitMQ_routing.rst:12
msgid "``CREATE`` → публикация события ``test-data-create``,"
msgstr "``CREATE`` → publishes the ``test-data-create`` event,"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/RabbitMQ_routing.rst:13
msgid "``UPDATE`` → публикация события ``test-data-update``,"
msgstr "``UPDATE`` → publishes the ``test-data-update`` event,"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/RabbitMQ_routing.rst:14
msgid ""
"прочие значения → выброс исключения (сообщение уходит в Dead Letter "
"Queue)."
msgstr ""
"other values → throws an exception (the message is sent to the Dead "
"Letter Queue)."

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/RabbitMQ_routing.rst:18
msgid ""
"Для работы примера необходимо создать ECOS Endpoint с именем ``my-"
"rabbitmq-endpoint``, содержащий ``url``, ``credentials/username`` и "
"``credentials/password``."
msgstr ""
"For the example to work, create an ECOS Endpoint named ``my-rabbitmq-"
"endpoint`` containing ``url``, ``credentials/username``, and "
"``credentials/password``."

